   "description": "<p>We're looking for experienced software engineers to build AI coding tasks from a codebase they know well. US$1,000 per task, and you can do as many tasks as you want.</p><p>You turn a real change from a repository you know into a task that today's best AI coding models struggle with: hard for the models, but fair for a skilled engineer. Your tasks are used to measure and train AI coding models.</p><p>Remote, any location. US$1,000 per task that passes review. Minimum of one task a week, about 10 hours a week.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
